{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8fd3f670-bfcc-8019-8f1a-aaa3a7d0da4c",
  "created_at": "2026-03-09T13:24:36-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carol Thurston",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:22:32-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:22:36-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Trash pickup. I need the new schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:22:39-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Is this for the holiday week schedule change? Or is something not getting picked up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:22:45-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both. It's the second miss in a row."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:22:49-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry about that. Two in a row is no good. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:22:55-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "35 Ayrault Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:22:57-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ayrault Street, up on the Hill. Got it. And is that a house or a building with multiple units?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:23:05-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Multiple units. I manage it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:23:08-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me pull up the route. [pause] So the crews run that side of the Hill on a set day, and the week after a holiday week things slide. Hang on, the sheet says the route works south from Bellevue that morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:23:24-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "North from Bellevue?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:23:26-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "South. South from Bellevue. Ayrault falls in that stretch, so you'd be later in the morning rather than first thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:23:34-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "South. Okay. What day is it now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:23:37-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Your pickup is back to your regular day this week. If you're a Monday route, which it looks like you are, that's today. So I'd get the bins out to the curb right away if they aren't already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:23:51-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They're out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:23:53-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Then they should get you today. Was the missed pickup last week, and the one before that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:24:00-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Both Mondays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:24:02-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, I'll put in a report for the missed pickups at 35 Ayrault so the supervisor sees it. If they don't come by end of day, call me back and we'll send someone out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:24:15-04:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:24:16-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want me to put a callback number on the report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:24:21-04:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0191."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:24:22-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0191. Perfect. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:24:25-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Carol Thurston."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:24:27-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Ms. Thurston. Anything else I can do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:24:31-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:24:33-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
